{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 Alicia's Reaper Scripts (What is this madness)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 These are scripts that I have either personally written to make my own workflow less painful, or convinced other, considerably more talented people to help me write when I reached the point of saying, \u8220"There has to be a better way to do this.\u8221"\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Most of these scripts were born out of necessity, laziness, curiosity, or some combination of all three. The primary goal has been to simplify my mixing, mastering, and general REAPER workflow by automating the repetitive nonsense that computers are supposed to be doing for us anyway.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 The collection covers a fairly ridiculous variety of tasks, including time tracking, repetitive workflow automation, audio-file processing, mixing preparation, file-integrity verification, and other assorted tools designed to save time over the long run.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Installing from my github repository\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Copy the following url and paste inside Extensions > ReaPack > Import a Repository:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 (https://github.com/alicia4prez/ReaScripts_lua/raw/master/index.xml)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 Included Scripts\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Scripts\\ALiXiA_Rea_PCM Digital Audio Fingerprint\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Scripts\\ALiXiA_DIatonic major minor mode transposer2\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Scripts\\ALiXiA_Session setup and ingestion\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Scripts\\ALiXiA_Studio Manager Script\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Scripts\\AliXiA_Real Stage Gaining Monitor For Mixing\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Scripts\\ALiXiA_Mix Prep and Session Sanitizer\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel4 \b \fs20 A Few Words From The Human Behind The Code\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 These scripts were created by a fallible human being who has absolutely no business being mentioned in the same sentence as the giants who write code in this community. I am merely wandering around in here with a keyboard, REAPER, Lua, and an unhealthy amount of confidence.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 I also possess the remarkable superpowers of Dyslexia and ADHD, which I have yet to successfully combine into a useful programming methodology. Instead, they occasionally collaborate to produce some truly spectacular typos, unexpected behaviors, and code that technically works but probably shouldn't. If you find something that appears to have been written by a caffeinated raccoon, there is a reasonable chance that I wrote it.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 If something is broken, please remember: it worked at one point. Probably. Maybe. I have witnesses.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Rather than throwing your computer out the window, please contact me through the REAPER Stash and let me know what is happening. I will gladly investigate and attempt to fix it as rapidly as humanly possible. Bug reports are welcome. Reproducing the bug is even better. Finding a bug that I somehow created six months ago and forgot about is basically a community service.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Everything in this repository is released under the GNU GPL v3.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Thank you. Seriously.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 And if you find something stupid in the code, please tell me before somebody else finds it and laughs at me publicly.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Se Habla Espanol!\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel5 \b \fs16 Donations\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 If our code ends up being useful and you'd like to throw a little support our way (to get foundation to cover up these dark spots under our eyes from endless nights of running in circles debugging):\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=GXEUXZN7GD7W4\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 No obligation, no guilt trip.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Just appreciation. \u10084 ?\u65039 ? ALiXiA Quinones and Rea Gem\u160 ?\par}
}
